ounty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Lafayette County. In 2025, August to September came in at 47% of normal and June to July at 150% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 198% and June to July at 82% on that same middle. Grid 22646 had its driest year in 1956 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
